  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      542.71,
      538.36,
      586.15
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure in the vicinity of Sri Lanka is moving westward away from island. However, the influence of this system may persist tomorrow.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      604.99,
      538.37,
      650.71
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, Northern, and North-western provinces and in Anuradhapura and Galle districts. Heavy falls above 100 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      654.4,
      538.34,
      694.3
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thunder showers will occur after 1.00 p.m. elsewhere of the island and Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      697.96,
      537.86,
      737.74
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      741.79,
      537.83,
      782.74
    ],
